/target
/.git
/.claude
/.vscode
/plan
/docs
/dashboard
/benches
/tests
/requests
# Image tarballs built by docs/deploy-rb5009.md §1, which live in the repo root
# and would otherwise be re-sent as build context on every later build.
*.tar
# tui-monitor is NOT excluded, and cannot be: the workspace `members` list
# names it, and a bin package whose `src/main.rs` is absent makes the manifest
# unloadable, so `--locked` fails before `-p fastadhunter` runs. It costs
# 217 KB of context and zero image bytes — the distroless stage copies one
# binary, and ratatui/crossterm are in none of that binary's 190 crates.
*.md
!crates/**/*.md
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
*.code-workspace
.gitignore
!/.probe-corpus
